   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unconditional Resources Transferred to support access to food: Maintain food consumption for 133,672 beneficiaries, which includes 90,000 refugees as per UNHCR figures living in the five camps who are food-insecure or most-at-risk-of-food-insecurity through the provision of dry rations under general food assistance (GFA), with the timely distribution of sufficient quantity and quality commodities over the assistance period insecurity amounting to 2,100 kcal per day per beneficiary. Plus the distribution of special nutritious food for pregnant and lactating women (PLWs) and children aged 6&#x2013;59 months.</narrative>
